              "text": "| Denoiser            | `DisplayReconstruction.wgsl`: 5 à-trous steps (1–16 px) stopped at normal, plane-distance, material and variance-scaled luminance edges (σ/n). Mirrors use only the 2 finest steps. Strength 1 to 4 spp, fades to 0 at 64 spp. Pairs best with the blue-noise pattern (decorrelated error filters out; shared-pattern error is the same in neighbouring pixels). |"
